== Effects ==
* [[Tinted rock]]s and rocks with {{r|Crawl Space}}s underneath flash white upon entering the room and every 10 seconds afterward.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either also makes {{r|Secret Room}} doors flash. Having both makes the gleam appears twice as often.

